254
00:19:06,080 --> 00:19:07,600
And so decided to dive all in.

255
00:19:07,920 --> 00:19:36,560
To-do lists or task management is an interesting space because it's incredibly crowded, but I feel like outside of like in the enterprise world where something like JIRA can quote unquote win, but even then you have linear and stuff, but like at a sort of personal level, even with as crowded as it is, it's so ubiquitous, like basically everybody who has a phone pretty much probably uses reminders in some capacity, right?

